{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"APPS.CHENG.9.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20261meKuyLONf1786760508.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"APPS.CHENG.9.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《風繼續吹》的無奈、《似水流年》的感嘆、《分分鐘需要你》的真摯、《隨想曲》的豁達⋯⋯ 鄭國江筆下的金曲，總有一首撩動過你心弦，滋潤著不同年代歌迷的精神生活。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"APPS.CHENG.10.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20265evGG1SdVu1786760515.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"APPS.CHENG.10.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"APPS.CHENG.8.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20267ZIauHAlr31786760951.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"APPS.CHENG.8.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"APPS.CHENG.14.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026oOJ41zqg0J1786760540.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"APPS.CHENG.14.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相隔十年，鄭國江再辦畫展，一幅幅以經典金曲為主題的，精選書法與水墨創作，讓我們「看見」上世紀廣東歌的盛世。策展人伍常就希望，透過展覽讓新一代，重新認識港樂情懷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新聞報道篇幅有限，我們特此輯錄伍常的訪問內容，讓大家認識更多展覽背後的點滴。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"APPS.CHENG.2.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026ysU31kkU9c1786760434.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"APPS.CHENG.2.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"APPS.CHENG.3.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20266C3Dl7XbOh1786760442.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"APPS.CHENG.3.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">記者：知道你今次用了一年半時間，籌備鄭國江的畫展，最具挑戰的地方在哪？</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">伍常：鄭國江老師本身很忙，雖然他已經85歲，今年5月他才完成了在伊利沙伯體育館的演唱會。這次有一個很幸福的煩惱，就是老師的作品種類非常多，除了有我們傳統的書法、水墨畫，也有很多設計的作品給我們選擇，所以我們這次在芸芸作品中，選取大概40幅作品，在中環大館展出他，十年來第一次的水墨展覽。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"APPS.CHENG.11.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20268Zs0SG4izv1786760522.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"APPS.CHENG.11.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"APPS.CHENG.5.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20260Y7gsO07BT1786760465.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"APPS.CHENG.5.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"APPS.CHENG.12.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Zc4aqO3CJ21786760527.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"APPS.CHENG.12.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">記者：挑選作品時有何準則？<br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">伍常：近期很多偉大的香港文化界前輩過身，我們經歷過一個「黃金盛世」，亦有很多偉大的人物仍健在，有很多偉大作品需要我們重新發掘、介紹，讓下一代認識，我希望透過這個小小的展覽，重溫我們上世紀，一些經典的流行曲，從多方面的視角，欣賞這些歌詞的美妙。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"APPS.CHENG.13.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026hHQBaKjeBw1786760533.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"APPS.CHENG.13.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"APPS.CHENG.4.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20266wp9dxpmJv1786760456.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"APPS.CHENG.4.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"APPS.CHENG.6.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026tsMcLfTyIy1786760473.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"APPS.CHENG.6.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">記者：希望透過畫展，讓大眾認識鄭國江怎樣的一面？</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">伍常：你見參觀的朋友橫跨不同世代，小至10歲的朋友都會來，透過書法作品，認識《信》這首歌 (劇集《阿信的故事》主題曲）。「命運是對手永不低頭」，我覺得這些字句，每個年代的朋友，都應該會有所感觸，所以我很開心在這場合，可以和大家分享，鄭老師這些美妙的歌詞。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"APPS.CHENG.7.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026866Yozgh3s1786760502.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"APPS.CHENG.7.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"APPS.CHENG.15.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20261tVzXssUtW1786760558.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"APPS.CHENG.15.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">採訪：陳尚萱</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">整理：鍾卓熹</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T02:59:36.135604+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":780,"images":14,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}